    "did_you_know": "Ruth Orkin photographed many of the most important classical musicians of the 20th century including Arthur Rubinstein, one of the finest classical pianists of the day<strong>.</strong>",
    "description": "Orkin was assigned by Rubinstein’s manager to photograph his daily activities. “I <em>only</em> had to keep up with him while he did all his various errands,” she recalled. In this image, she captured his chance encounter on the street with a friend, movie star Basil Rathbone. At the end of the day, the musician seemed fine, but Orkin was exhausted, “even though he is at least thirty-five years older than I am!”",
